(O114 - Measure Outside Back-Left Corner)
(O114 probes back Y+ and left X- and sets the outside corner to X0 Y0)

O114 sub
    #<probe_vel> = #<_ini[PROBE]VEL>
    #<search_dist> = #<_ini[PROBE]SEARCH_DIST>
    #<xy_clear> = #<_ini[PROBE]XY_CLEARANCE>
    #<z_drop> = #<_ini[PROBE]Z_DROP>
    #<probe_diam> = #<_ini[PROBE]DIAMETER>
    #<radius> = [#<probe_diam> / 2.0]
    #<start_x> = #5420
    #<start_y> = #5421
    G90
    (Move left at the current safe Z height before dropping)
    G0 X[#<start_x> - #<xy_clear>]
    G91
    G0 Z-#<z_drop>
    G38.2 Y#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<y1> = #5062
    G0 Y-#<xy_clear>
    G0 Z#<z_drop>
    G90
    G0 X#<start_x> Y#<start_y>
    (Move back at the safe height, then drop and search left)
    G0 Y[#<start_y> + #<xy_clear>]
    G91
    G0 Z-#<z_drop>
    G38.2 X-#<search_dist> F#<probe_vel>
    #<x1> = #5061
    G0 X#<xy_clear>
    G0 Z#<z_drop>
    G90
    G0 X#<start_x> Y#<start_y>
    G0 X[#<x1> + #<radius>] Y[#<y1> - #<radius>]
    G10 L20 P0 X[#<x1> + #<radius>]
    G10 L20 P0 Y[#<y1> - #<radius>]
O114 endsub
M2
